[ours-only: full flag set: OpenPressure reads all 60 slots of bank 1 from slot 0 in 48-byte blocks; Omron reads the same records starting at the newest slot] reads 0x98 960 chunk=48

# Omron reads the same 60 records, starting at the newest slot (4) and wrapping to slots 0-3. Its unsent subset is
# the whole bank here; in general Omron reads only unsent records while OpenPressure reads every slot of a full bank.
# Both clients agree on every record they both read.
[omron-only: full flag set: Omron 2026.09.03 reads slots 4-59 from the newest record, observed in the sandbox] reads 0xd8 896 chunk=48
[omron-only: Omron then wraps to slots 0-2] reads 0x98 48 chunk=48
[omron-only: Omron then reads slot 3, the last unsent record before the newest] reads 0xc8 16 chunk=16

reads 0x458 16 chunk=16

[omron-only: Omron 2026.09.03 post-transfer index prefix at 0x54 for this index: user 1's full position word and unsent count kept, the last-read user 2's unsent counter cleared; recorded from the sandbox exploration transcript] write tx 1801c0005410 054001003c0000809600000001000000 00f2
